{"headword":"גָּדַע","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. hew, hew down</strong> or <strong>off (</strong>NH <em>id.</em> (rare), Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדַע</span> Ithp.; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَدَعَ</span> <em>cut off</em> hand or other member, <em>mutilate</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.3\">La 2:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְגָדַעְתִּ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:31\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.31\">1 S 2:31</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶגְדַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.10\">Zc 11:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.14\">14</a>; Pt. pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.2\">Is 15:2</a> (so many edd. but) Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרוּעָה</span>; cf. infr., <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֻעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:33\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.33\">Is 10:33</a>;—<em>hew, cut in two</em>, a staff <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.10\">Zc 11:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.14\">14</a>; metaph. <em>hew off</em>, an arm <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:31\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.31\">1 S 2:31</a>; horns <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.3\">La 2:3</a>; <em>hew down</em>, trees <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:33\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.33\">Is 10:33</a>; if in <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.2\">Is 15:2</a> then = <em>shave off</em> (object <span dir=\"rtl\">זקן</span>, beard), but no other indication of this meaning, and true MT <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרוּעָה</span>, cf. Baer’s note & <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.37\">Je 48:37</a>; v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, גָּרַע\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּרַע\">גרע</a>."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְדַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:6\" href=\"/Judges.21.6\">Ju 21:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶגְדַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.23\">Je 50:23</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְדְּעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.25\">Je 48:25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנִגְדְּעָה</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.25\">Is 22:25</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְדַּעְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.12\">Is 14:12</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנִגְדְּעוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.6\">Ez 6:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:14\" href=\"/Amos.3.14\">Am 3:14</a>;—<em>be hewn off</em>, of altarhorns <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:14\" href=\"/Amos.3.14\">Am 3:14</a>, of idols <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.6\">Ez 6:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁבר</span>); of severance of a tribe from nation <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:6\" href=\"/Judges.21.6\">Ju 21:6</a>; fig. of king of Babylon <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.12\">Is 14:12</a>; of Babylon as hammer <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.23\">Je 50:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁבר</span>); of a minister, under fig. of secure per or pin <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.25\">Is 22:25</a>; of horn of Moab <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.25\">Je 48:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁבר</span>)."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּדַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.7\">2 Ch 34:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּדֵּ֑עַ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.4\">2 Ch 34:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:16\" href=\"/Psalms.107.16\">ψ 107:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְגַדַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.2\">2 Ch 14:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַדֵּ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:11\" href=\"/Psalms.75.11\">ψ 75:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.2\">Is 45:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְגַדְּעוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.1\">2 Ch 31:1</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּגַדֵּע֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.5\">Dt 7:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.3\">12:3</a>;—<em>hew off, down, in two</em> (cf. Qal) of <em>Asherîm</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.5\">Dt 7:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.2\">2 Ch 14:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.1\">31:1</a>, of idols <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.3\">Dt 12:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(פְּסִילִים)</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.4\">2 Ch 34:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.7\">7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(חַמָּנִים)</span>; fig. horns of wicked <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:11\" href=\"/Psalms.75.11\">ψ 75:11</a>; bars of iron (i.e. of Babylon’s gates) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.2\">Is 45:2</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:16\" href=\"/Psalms.107.16\">ψ 107:16</a>."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֻּדָּ֑עוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.9\">Is 9:9</a> <em>be hewn down</em> (of trees)."}],"all_cited":true,"form":"Pu."}]},"rid":"BDB01677","strong_numbers":["1438"],"next_hw":"גִּדְעוֹן","prev_hw":"מִגְדֹּל","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["1548"],"TWOT":["316"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}